      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Megaman came to Java Island, Indonesia several months ago, then met Kalinka and her father, Dr. Cossack in Tanah Abang, Jakarta. But, when Megaman came back to his hometown, a new problem began...\r\n\r\nTry the new adventure, and thanks for playing.\r\n\r\nEnjoy~\r\n\r\n[i]The v1.1 released on 24 April 2012. There has been major improvement and bugfixes. See the Readme file for more information. Please report me if you find bugs in my hack.[/i]"
    }
